    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/401549f314eb8cd9c58e395344c71910.poster.avif?t=1724515114\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/401549f314eb8cd9c58e395344c71910.webm?t=1724515114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/401549f314eb8cd9c58e395344c71910.mp4?t=1724515114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The evil robots want to eat all the baby chickens!</strong><br><br>Help Henrietta to save all the chicks from the evil Robojaws by using the arrows and blocks available in each of the 100 levels. You'll discover new places in the map as well as some items that will help you in your quest. Every area has its own style and challenges\u2026 Will you be able to solve all the puzzles in Rollo Pollo?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/9bf8cb8e8b7afd5b59374269f11cf9e3.avif?t=1724515114\" width=512 height=153 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan Your Strategy</h2><br>Choose wisely where to place the limited number of arrows and blocking cubes to redirect the chickens and the robots. They\u2019ll follow the direction of the arrows they step on and they\u2019ll turn right if they find an obstacle on their way. Take Henrietta to the henhouse and solve the puzzle, and don\u2019t forget to pick up all the chicks if you can!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/b6a25821a0213c25ac0c076bbeedfd2c.avif?t=1724515114\" width=512 height=153 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>single Player Puzzle Game<br></li><li>+100 Levels<br></li><li>10 Different Areas<br></li><li>Twisted gameplay blocks like teleports, broken floors, jumps\u2026<br></li><li>Fun map to meet friends in the game<br></li><li>Secret feathers to unlock new areas</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/401549f314eb8cd9c58e395344c71910.poster.avif?t=1724515114\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/401549f314eb8cd9c58e395344c71910.webm?t=1724515114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/401549f314eb8cd9c58e395344c71910.mp4?t=1724515114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The evil robots want to eat all the baby chickens!</strong><br><br>Help Henrietta to save all the chicks from the evil Robojaws by using the arrows and blocks available in each of the 100 levels. You'll discover new places in the map as well as some items that will help you in your quest. Every area has its own style and challenges\u2026 Will you be able to solve all the puzzles in Rollo Pollo?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/9bf8cb8e8b7afd5b59374269f11cf9e3.avif?t=1724515114\" width=512 height=153 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan Your Strategy</h2><br>Choose wisely where to place the limited number of arrows and blocking cubes to redirect the chickens and the robots. They\u2019ll follow the direction of the arrows they step on and they\u2019ll turn right if they find an obstacle on their way. Take Henrietta to the henhouse and solve the puzzle, and don\u2019t forget to pick up all the chicks if you can!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092900/extras/b6a25821a0213c25ac0c076bbeedfd2c.avif?t=1724515114\" width=512 height=153 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>single Player Puzzle Game<br></li><li>+100 Levels<br></li><li>10 Different Areas<br></li><li>Twisted gameplay blocks like teleports, broken floors, jumps\u2026<br></li><li>Fun map to meet friends in the game<br></li><li>Secret feathers to unlock new areas</li></ul>",
